  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating VCT with Home Based Care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FRACODEP implements an HIV and AIDS home based care (HBC) project for people living with HIV and AIDS (PLWHA) in the three parishes; St. Paul, Rang&#x2019;ala and Nyang&#x2019;oma. This project will focus on HIV prevention and HBC in two parishes of Rang&#x2019;ala and Nyang&#x2019;oma. The project will provide friendly Voluntary Counselling and Testing (VCT) services, capacity building for staff, PLWHA and vounteers, community mobilisation and sensitisation, production and dissemination of IEC materials and networking and collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
